  <!-- ── Gifting ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>CAN I GIVE THIS AS A GIFT</pattern>
    <template>A commissioned song makes one of the most meaningful gifts imaginable — something entirely original that no store could offer. You provide the details about the person being celebrated, we craft and produce the song, and you present the finished recording as your gift. We can also keep the process entirely off their radar if you'd like it to be a surprise.
      <nav-card label="Commission a Gift Song" href="/contact"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>IS THIS A GOOD GIFT</pattern>
    <template><srai>CAN I GIVE THIS AS A GIFT</srai></template>
  </category>

