  </category>

  <!-- ── Worth it ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>IS IT WORTH IT</pattern>
    <template>A Brass Note Studios commission is a permanent, original piece of art created specifically for you or your organization — something that can be streamed, performed, and treasured for years. Many of our clients say it was the most meaningful gift they have ever given or received. The real question is whether the moment deserves something truly original.
      <nav-card label="Explore Commissions" href="/services"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>IS IT WORTH THE PRICE</pattern>
    <template><srai>IS IT WORTH IT</srai></template>
