  <!-- ── Individual vs Creator ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IS THE DIFFERENCE BETWEEN INDIVIDUAL AND CREATOR</pattern>
    <template>The commission type reflects your intended use. Individual Commissions are for personal occasions — weddings, birthdays, memorials — and the song is yours to keep. Creator Commissions are designed for channel branding, intro music, and social content, and come with full usage rights across all platforms. Pricing starts at $199 for both.</template>
  </category>

